        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 26 at 12:29AM PDT until September 26 at 8:00AM PDT by NWS Portland OR</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...For the first Small Craft Advisory, seas 7 to 8 ft at 9
seconds and northwest winds 5 to 10 kt. For the second Small
Craft Advisory, seas 4 to 7 ft at 8 seconds and north winds 10
to 25 kt expected.

* WHERE...Coastal waters from Cape Shoalwater WA to Cape Falcon
OR out 10 NM and Waters from Cape Shoalwater WA to Cape Falcon
OR from 10 to 60 NM.

* WHEN...Small Craft Advisory, until 8 AM PDT this morning.
Small Craft Advisory, from 5 PM this afternoon to 5 AM PDT
Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
